VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'plug-and-play device. I didn\'t want to go in and play around with a bunch of settings. But, I do think it\'s very convenient that you have this option because this isn\'t something that I\'ve seen with a lot of other devices. Now, the KeyX does give you up to 32-bit'

[02:33] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'playback. So, again, because you\'re using a wired device and because you\'re getting up to 32-bit playback, this is essentially like listening to a CD or whatever straight from the source. Uh you\'re not having to rely on high-end'

[02:46] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
